    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Let's Cook! Cavy! ,\u00a0 players will step into the shoes of Cavy AA, a young chef with a passion for cooking. She harbors a unique dream: to let people all over the continent savor the delicacies she meticulously prepares. With the sponsorship of a mysterious benefactor, AA is about to embark on a culinary journey around the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing and enjoyable 2D simulation business game. Players will drive AA's food truck to various locations, greeting a diverse array of animal customers. By operating the keyboard, players need to fulfill the orders of the guests. Based on different requirements and tastes, they must carefully prepare satisfying dishes to earn the customers' praise and gold coin rewards. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Let's Cook! Cavy! ,\u00a0 players will step into the shoes of Cavy AA, a young chef with a passion for cooking. She harbors a unique dream: to let people all over the continent savor the delicacies she meticulously prepares. With the sponsorship of a mysterious benefactor, AA is about to embark on a culinary journey around the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing and enjoyable 2D simulation business game. Players will drive AA's food truck to various locations, greeting a diverse array of animal customers. By operating the keyboard, players need to fulfill the orders of the guests. Based on different requirements and tastes, they must carefully prepare satisfying dishes to earn the customers' praise and gold coin rewards. </p>",
    "short_description": "Let's Cook! Cavy! is a 2D simulation game. Players play as Cavy AA, the chef hamster. With a mysterious sponsor, AA drives a food truck across the continent. Visit different locations, greet animal customers, and serve them delicious meals. The goal is to let all taste the carefully prepared food.",
